- Reason for reading books is in [Entertainment Purpose, To increase my English vocabulary knowledge]
- Department is in [BBA, English, JMC, Textile, Others]
- Amount of time spent reading books per day < 1
- Favorite books for reading to spend leisure time is in [Fiction, Politics]
- Frequency of reading books is in [Rarely, Once a week]
- Number of printed books you read last two years is in [1-5, nan]
- Number of e-books you read last two years is in [1-5, nan]
- What is the change that you felt after reading books is not in [Increase Academic Performance, Increase Creative Thinking]
- How to manage books for reading is in [Borrow, Others]
- Do you read Newspaper is No

10 different conditions for class "1" (Reads academic books most of the time):

- Reason for reading books is Academic Purpose
- Department is in [CSE, SWE, Pharmacy, EEE, CIS, Civil, MCT]
- Amount of time spent reading books per day >= 1
- Frequency of reading books is in [On everyday basis, A few times a week]
- Number of printed books you read last two years is in [6-10, 11-15, 16-20, More than 20]
- Number of e-books you read last two years is in [6-10, 11-15, 16-20, More than 20]
- What is the change that you felt after reading books is in [Increase Academic Performance, Increase Creative Thinking]
